The Volkswagen Polo SE Design trim was part of the Mk5 generation (2009-2017), specifically available around 2013-2016, often associated with the facelifted Mk5 (Typ 6C from 2014). It added styling elements to the standard SE trim. I will evaluate based on the 1.2 TSI 90 PS engine, a common option for this trim.

*   **Price (price_usd):** Used prices for 2014-2016 Polo SE Design models range from around £5,950 to £9,980. This is well below the $10,000 threshold for a +1.00 score. Score: +1.00.
